          "x": 0.41,
          "y": 0.47,
          "align": "center",
          "size": 25,
          "variant": "bubble",
          "color": "#111111",
          "text": {
            "en": "Thank you for saving me from the goblins! I was imprisoned by the guards and you defeated them!",
            "it": "Grazie per avermi salvata dai goblin! Le guardie mi tenevano prigioniera e tu le hai sconfitte!",
